WEBVTT


00:00:00.340 --> 00:00:02.520
Shut up and help me look for signs of civilization.

00:00:02.660 --> 00:00:03.940
I think I saw a boy. Wait,

00:00:03.941 --> 00:00:04.981
you saw a boy? Where? Boy,

00:00:04.982 --> 00:00:06.021
shut the hell up and let me sleep.

00:00:06.022 --> 00:00:08.921
I'm about five seconds from eating you.
